        "TileImage": "$($repository 28cb7e91-bf9c-46ee-a371-1bd1448f1994).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome to Berlin, 47.\r\r------------------ START AT RADIO TOWER --------------------\r\rYou are tasked to eliminate a few rouge ICA agents who happen to conflict with the company agenda. Other agents are on the lookout for them, but we are to refrain from terminating them. \r\r\rTIPS:\r- A counter sniper may mistake you as a rouge. Don&apos;t kill him.\r- The former power plant is decorated with a variety of hanging objects.\r- Timing is key.\r\rThis mission will send a message to any ICA traitors. Good luck.",
